{"id":"a5c5e1ecc74ddea5","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-geometric-structure.md","title":"Geometric Structure","display":"df-geometric-structure — Geometric Structure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-geometric-structure","aliases":["58-df-geometric-structure","Geometric Structure"],"display":"df-geometric-structure — Geometric Structure","depends_on":["[[58-df-atlas]]","[[58-df-manifold]]","[[58-df-smooth-lie-action-data.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-geometric-structure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-geometric-structure</span><span>Geometric Structure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-geometric-structure — Geometric Structure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d530952583f9f96d\" href=\"?note=d530952583f9f96d\" title=\"58-df-atlas\">58-df-atlas</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0e800aa519680c23\" href=\"?note=0e800aa519680c23\" title=\"58-df-manifold\">58-df-manifold</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6d51f43eabef852a\" href=\"?note=6d51f43eabef852a\" title=\"58-df-smooth-lie-action-data.md\">58-df-smooth-lie-action-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c4b4a825f2ea608d\" href=\"?note=c4b4a825f2ea608d\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md\">../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Atlas}_S\\subseteq V^{4}\">\\(\\mathrm{Atlas}_S\\subseteq V^{4}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GeometricStructure}_S\\subseteq V^{8}\">\\(\\mathrm{GeometricStructure}_S\\subseteq V^{8}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LieGroup}_S\\subseteq V^{1}\">\\(\\mathrm{LieGroup}_S\\subseteq V^{1}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LocalModelTransition}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\">\\(\\mathrm{LocalModelTransition}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Manifold}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\operatorname{Manifold}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SmoothTransitiveAction}_S\\subseteq V^{4}\">\\(\\mathrm{SmoothTransitiveAction}_S\\subseteq V^{4}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,X,G,\\mathcal A,\\tau_M,\\tau_X,\\rho\\in V\">\\(M,X,G,\\mathcal A,\\tau_M,\\tau_X,\\rho\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Manifold}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{Manifold}_S\\)</span> (manifold predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0e800aa519680c23\" href=\"?note=0e800aa519680c23\" title=\"58-df-manifold\">58-df-manifold</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Atlas}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Atlas}_S\\)</span> (atlas predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d530952583f9f96d\" href=\"?note=d530952583f9f96d\" title=\"58-df-atlas\">58-df-atlas</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LieGroup}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{LieGroup}_S\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SmoothTransitiveAction}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SmoothTransitiveAction}_S\\)</span> 使用 <code>58-df-smooth-lie-action-data</code> 的共同群结构和光滑作用数据。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_M|_U=\\{W\\cap U:W\\in\\tau_M\\}\">\\(\\tau_M|_U=\\{W\\cap U:W\\in\\tau_M\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_X|_W=\\{O\\cap W:O\\in\\tau_X\\}\">\\(\\tau_X|_W=\\{O\\cap W:O\\in\\tau_X\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ModelAtlas}_{58}\">\\(\\mathrm{ModelAtlas}_{58}\\)</span> 按下式定义。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LocalModelTransition}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{LocalModelTransition}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GeometricStructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{GeometricStructure}_S\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Homeo}\">\\(\\mathrm{Homeo}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c4b4a825f2ea608d\" href=\"?note=c4b4a825f2ea608d\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md\">../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ModelAtlas}_{58}(\\mathcal A,M,\\tau_M,X,\\tau_X)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(M,\\tau_M)\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\bigl[\\forall c\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\exists U\\in\\tau_M\\;\\exists W\\in\\tau_X\\;\\exists\\phi\\in V\\;\n(c=\\langle U,W,\\phi\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Homeo}_S(\\phi,U,\\tau_M|_U,W,\\tau_X|_W))\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land M=\\bigcup\\{U:\\exists W,\\phi\\;(\\langle U,W,\\phi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ModelAtlas}_{58}(\\mathcal A,M,\\tau_M,X,\\tau_X)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(M,\\tau_M)\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\bigl[\\forall c\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\exists U\\in\\tau_M\\;\\exists W\\in\\tau_X\\;\\exists\\phi\\in V\\;\n(c=\\langle U,W,\\phi\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Homeo}_S(\\phi,U,\\tau_M|_U,W,\\tau_X|_W))\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land M=\\bigcup\\{U:\\exists W,\\phi\\;(\\langle U,W,\\phi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}geometric\\text{-}structure\\text{-}transition}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LocalModelTransition}_S(c,d,\\tau_M,\\rho,G)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists U,V,U&#39;,V&#39;,\\phi,\\psi,X\\;\\Bigl(c=\\langle U,U&#39;,\\phi\\rangle\\land d=\\langle V,V&#39;,\\psi\\rangle\n\\land U&#39;,V&#39;\\subseteq X\\land\\rho\\in(X^X)^G\\land\\phi\\in(U&#39;)^U\\land\\psi\\in(V&#39;)^V\n\\land\\operatorname{ran}\\phi=U&#39;\\land\\operatorname{ran}\\psi=V&#39;\n\\land\\bigl[\\forall a,b\\in U\\;(\\phi(a)=\\phi(b)\\to a=b)\\bigr]\n\\land\\bigl[\\forall a,b\\in V\\;(\\psi(a)=\\psi(b)\\to a=b)\\bigr]\\land\n\\forall p\\in U\\cap V\\;\\exists W\\in\\tau_M\\;\\exists g\\in G\\;\n\\bigl(p\\in W\\subseteq U\\cap V\\land(\\psi\\circ\\phi^{-1})\\upharpoonright\\phi[W]=\\rho(g)\\upharpoonright\\phi[W]\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}geometric\\text{-}structure\\text{-}transition}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LocalModelTransition}_S(c,d,\\tau_M,\\rho,G)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists U,V,U&#39;,V&#39;,\\phi,\\psi,X\\;\\Bigl(c=\\langle U,U&#39;,\\phi\\rangle\\land d=\\langle V,V&#39;,\\psi\\rangle\n\\land U&#39;,V&#39;\\subseteq X\\land\\rho\\in(X^X)^G\\land\\phi\\in(U&#39;)^U\\land\\psi\\in(V&#39;)^V\n\\land\\operatorname{ran}\\phi=U&#39;\\land\\operatorname{ran}\\psi=V&#39;\n\\land\\bigl[\\forall a,b\\in U\\;(\\phi(a)=\\phi(b)\\to a=b)\\bigr]\n\\land\\bigl[\\forall a,b\\in V\\;(\\psi(a)=\\psi(b)\\to a=b)\\bigr]\\land\n\\forall p\\in U\\cap V\\;\\exists W\\in\\tau_M\\;\\exists g\\in G\\;\n\\bigl(p\\in W\\subseteq U\\cap V\\land(\\psi\\circ\\phi^{-1})\\upharpoonright\\phi[W]=\\rho(g)\\upharpoonright\\phi[W]\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}geometric\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GeometricStructure}_S(\\mathcal A,M,\\tau_M,n,X,\\tau_X,G,\\rho)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Manifold}_S(M,\\tau_M,n)\\land\\operatorname{Manifold}_S(X,\\tau_X,n)\\land\n\\mathrm{LieGroup}_S(G)\\land\\mathrm{SmoothTransitiveAction}_S(\\rho,G,X,\\tau_X)\\land\n\\mathrm{ModelAtlas}_{58}(\\mathcal A,M,\\tau_M,X,\\tau_X)\\land\n\\forall c,d\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\mathrm{LocalModelTransition}_S(c,d,\\tau_M,\\rho,G)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}geometric\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GeometricStructure}_S(\\mathcal A,M,\\tau_M,n,X,\\tau_X,G,\\rho)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Manifold}_S(M,\\tau_M,n)\\land\\operatorname{Manifold}_S(X,\\tau_X,n)\\land\n\\mathrm{LieGroup}_S(G)\\land\\mathrm{SmoothTransitiveAction}_S(\\rho,G,X,\\tau_X)\\land\n\\mathrm{ModelAtlas}_{58}(\\mathcal A,M,\\tau_M,X,\\tau_X)\\land\n\\forall c,d\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\mathrm{LocalModelTransition}_S(c,d,\\tau_M,\\rho,G)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(G,X)\">\\((G,X)\\)</span> 坐标卡的像是模型 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 的开集，而不是不加转换地拿欧氏坐标卡去与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 上的作用复合。局部过渡、作用参数和模型图册的原有调用接口保留；这里只补全各构造的载体和函数域。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Thurston, Three-Dimensional Geometry and Topology</li>\n<li>Sharpe, Differential Geometry</li>\n<li>Kobayashi, Transformation Groups in Differential Geometry&quot;</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-atlas","status":"resolved","id":